Package: packet-desk
Version: 0.3.0
Section: hamradio
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Packet Desk Project <packet-desk@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), python3-serial, python3-tk
Description: Linux packet-radio terminal for Kantronics TNCs
 Serial terminal for TNCs running in TERMINAL mode. Provides command
 shortcuts, a packet monitor transcript, and session logging.
